{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>You shall not pervert.</b> It speaks with the judge, like <b>before YHWH your Elohim you shall eat it</b> (Deuteronomy 15:20) — what is fit to be eaten, as though it speaks with the priest. And [the word] separates it from all Israel, that it speaks with them. And one who says that it refers to the firstborn of the flock — that is nonsense."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:33.131007850Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}